    {
      "text": "Lairon feeds on iron contained in rocks and water. It makes its nest on mountains where iron ore is buried. As a result, the Pokémon often clashes with humans mining the iron ore.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lairon live in mountains brimming with spring water and iron ore, so these Pokémon often came into conflict with humans in the past.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "During territorial disputes, Lairon fight by slamming into each other. Close inspection of their steel armor reveals scratches and dents.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
